Z||000000||batboy||03-06-2000||10:58 PM||||Just got these today from RCC: rear coil-over conversion kit (with spanner) and bump steer kit, tie rod ends were not included (I put those new Moog units on for the pic). Looks great! I have the rear control arms off right now and am putting new ball joints and poly bushing into them.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://sites.netscape.net/gardengoddessl/coilover.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 03-06-2000).]||||reg||1
